<div style="font-family: Garamond, Georgia, serif; color: #1a1a1a; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 620px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 30px 24px;">
  <p>Dear <%= @recommendation.name.to_s.split.first %>,</p>

  <p>I hope you're well. <strong><%= @client.name %></strong> has reviewed your profile and would like to invite you for an interview.</p>

  <p>Could you please share <strong>three time slots</strong> over the coming days that would work well for you? Once you've sent them through, we'll confirm the one that suits the client's schedule and share any additional details (format, attendees, etc.) ahead of the call.</p>

  <p>You can simply reply to this email — Laurenz is in copy and will help coordinate.</p>

  <p>Looking forward to your reply.</p>

  <p style="margin-top: 28px;">Best regards,<br>Laurenz Gerold<br>Gerold &amp; Partners</p>
</div>
